Guralnick–Malle, Classification of 2F-modules I, Proposition 5.1, pp.15–16,
and Theorem 6.6/Table 6.7. See `../source/README.md` for original attribution.
Generated by `source/generate.py`; numerical identities use `decide +kernel`.
-/

